+### `createPatch(from, to)`
+
+Returns a JSON Patch ([RFC 6902](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)) that turns `from` into `to` when passed to
+`applyPatch`, made of `add`, `remove` and `replace` operations with escaped JSON Pointer paths. It describes only what
