+# Plan: Create JSON Patch
+New `src/diff.ts` exporting `createPatch`; `equal`/`clone` exported from `src/patch.ts` for reuse.
+Algorithm: recursive `diff(from, to, path, ops)`; arrays trim common prefix/suffix, LCS on the middle, walk the edit
+script with a cursor emitting indexes valid at the time each op is applied; adjacent delete/insert runs are paired and
+diffed recursively (or replaced when the nested patch is not smaller).
+## Constitution Check
+- I: RFC 6902 §4/§5, RFC 6901 §3/§4 named. II: no dependencies. III: tests first in `test/diff.test.js`, round-tripped
+  through `applyPatch`. IV: inputs cloned into the patch, never mutated. V: typed, doc comment, exported from index.
+  VI: one small module.
